      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 6.5600000000000005,
      "text": "因为睡觉，就是会影\n响你所有东西的表现"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 11.72,
      "id": "cue-6",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 9.96,
      "text": "你如果去健身，你没有睡好的话"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 14.44,
      "id": "cue-7",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 11.72,
      "text": "你肯定也做不好，而且会很累、很难受"
